{"seq":1,"slug":"governance-technical-debt","title":"治理与技术债：开关数量控制、过期策略与代码清理自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/operations/governance-technical-debt","wordCount":1424,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"治理与技术债-开关数量控制-过期策略与代码清理自动化\">治理与技术债：开关数量控制、过期策略与代码清理自动化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>开关治理要解决的是一组<strong>结构性矛盾</strong>：创建开关的成本趋近于零，而清理成本高达前者的数十倍，两者不对称导致债务在快速迭代中必然累积。治理的目标，就是用制度与自动化把这条曲线拉平。</p>\n<p>围绕这一目标，本节展开几个概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>预算与配额</strong>：用团队级开关数量上限和创建/归档比，倒逼主动清理；</li>\n<li><strong>阶梯式过期</strong>：告警从通知、建单到阻断创建逐级升级，避免开关被遗忘；</li>\n<li><strong>清理自动化与度量</strong>：安全预检 + AI 代码变更 + 人工审查构成清理流水线，债务分数让问题可见。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要治理\">为什么需要治理</h2><p>特性开关系统的悖论：<strong>开关越容易创建，债务越容易累积</strong>。一行 <code>if (flag.isEnabled())</code> 的创建成本几乎为零，但清理成本涉及代码变更、测试更新、跨服务协调、安全验证——是创建成本的 10-50 倍。</p>\n<p>当组织缺乏治理时，技术债的增长呈超线性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>开关数量</th>\n<th>代码复杂度增长</th>\n<th>测试矩阵增长</th>\n<th>认知负担</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 1024</td>\n<td>可管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50</td>\n<td>超线性</td>\n<td>不可枚举</td>\n<td>困难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>200+</td>\n<td>指数级</td>\n<td>不可测试</td>\n<td>不可控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Knight Capital（2012年，因旧开关意外激活导致 4.6 亿美元损失）和 Facebook（2021年 BGP 配置变更导致全球宕机 6 小时）都是治理缺失的极端后果。快手 2026 年分享揭示了另一种日常痛点：一个早年推全的开关，旧逻辑无人维护，某天因网络抖动拉不到值后走入旧路径，引发线上故障。</p>\n<h2 id=\"开关预算制度\">开关预算制度</h2><h3 id=\"团队级开关预算\">团队级开关预算</h3><p>为每个团队设定活跃开关的数量上限，超出则阻止创建新开关：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[工程师请求创建新开关] --&gt; B{团队活跃开关数 &lt; 预算?}&#10;    B -- 是 --&gt; C[允许创建]&#10;    B -- 否 --&gt; D[阻止创建]&#10;    D --&gt; E[必须先清理一个旧开关]&#10;    E --&gt; F[清理完成后重新请求]&#10;    F --&gt; B\">flowchart TD\n    A[工程师请求创建新开关] --&gt; B{团队活跃开关数 &lt; 预算?}\n    B -- 是 --&gt; C[允许创建]\n    B -- 否 --&gt; D[阻止创建]\n    D --&gt; E[必须先清理一个旧开关]\n    E --&gt; F[清理完成后重新请求]\n    F --&gt; B</pre><p><strong>预算设定参考</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>团队规模</th>\n<th>推荐预算</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>3-5 人</td>\n<td>10-15 个</td>\n<td>小团队认知带宽有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6-12 人</td>\n<td>15-25 个</td>\n<td>中等团队，需要分类管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>13-20 人</td>\n<td>25-40 个</td>\n<td>大团队，建议按子团队拆分预算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"创建-归档比监控\">创建/归档比监控</h3><p>健康的开关系统维持 <strong>1:1 的创建/归档比</strong>——每创建一个新开关，就应该归档一个旧开关：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def check_flag_budget_health(team: str, period_days: int = 30) -&gt; HealthReport:&#10;    created = count_flags_created(team, period_days)&#10;    archived = count_flags_archived(team, period_days)&#10;    active = count_active_flags(team)&#10;    budget = get_team_budget(team)&#10;&#10;    ratio = created / max(archived, 1)&#10;    utilization = active / budget&#10;&#10;    return HealthReport(&#10;        team=team,&#10;        create_archive_ratio=ratio,      # 目标 &lt;= 1.5&#10;        budget_utilization=utilization,   # 目标 &lt;= 0.8&#10;        active_count=active,&#10;        stale_count=count_stale_flags(team),&#10;    )\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> check_flag_budget_health</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(team: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, period_days: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> HealthReport:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    created </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count_flags_created(team, period_days)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    archived </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count_flags_archived(team, period_days)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    active </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count_active_flags(team)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    budget </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_team_budget(team)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ratio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(archived, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    utilization </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> active </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> budget</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HealthReport(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        team</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">team,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        create_archive_ratio</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ratio,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 目标 &#x3C;= 1.5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        budget_utilization</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">utilization,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 目标 &#x3C;= 0.8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        active_count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">active,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        stale_count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">count_stale_flags(team),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"过期策略与自动化\">过期策略与自动化</h2><h3 id=\"过期告警阶梯\">过期告警阶梯</h3><p>对临时开关（Release/Experiment）实施<strong>阶梯式过期告警</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>升级对象</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>黄色</td>\n<td>超期 7 天</td>\n<td>Slack 通知 owner</td>\n<td>开关创建者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>橙色</td>\n<td>超期 14 天</td>\n<td>创建清理工单</td>\n<td>团队负责人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>红色</td>\n<td>超期 30 天</td>\n<td>阻断该团队新开关创建</td>\n<td>Engineering Manager</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>紫色</td>\n<td>超期 60 天</td>\n<td>强制清理计划 + 上报</td>\n<td>VP of Engineering</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"过期自动执行\">过期自动执行</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 自动过期策略配置&#10;expiration_policy:&#10;  release_flags:&#10;    soft_deadline_days: 30&#10;    hard_deadline_days: 60&#10;    actions:&#10;      soft_deadline:&#10;        - notify_owner_slack&#10;        - create_jira_ticket&#10;        - add_to_sprint_backlog&#10;      hard_deadline:&#10;        - block_team_flag_creation&#10;        - notify_engineering_manager&#10;        - schedule_forced_cleanup&#10;&#10;  experiment_flags:&#10;    soft_deadline_days: 90&#10;    hard_deadline_days: 120&#10;    actions:&#10;      soft_deadline:&#10;        - notify_data_team&#10;        - request_experiment_decision&#10;      hard_deadline:&#10;        - force_experiment_conclusion&#10;        - archive_with_winner_variant\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 自动过期策略配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">expiration_policy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  release_flags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    soft_deadline_days</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    hard_deadline_days</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    actions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      soft_deadline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">notify_owner_slack</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">create_jira_ticket</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">add_to_sprint_backlog</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      hard_deadline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">block_team_flag_creation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">notify_engineering_manager</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">schedule_forced_cleanup</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  experiment_flags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    soft_deadline_days</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    hard_deadline_days</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">120</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    actions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      soft_deadline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">notify_data_team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">request_experiment_decision</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      hard_deadline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">force_experiment_conclusion</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">archive_with_winner_variant</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"ai-驱动的代码清理自动化\">AI 驱动的代码清理自动化</h2><p>2025-2026 年，AI 驱动的开关清理成为行业主流方向。核心理念：将&quot;判断哪些开关可清理&quot;和&quot;执行代码变更&quot;两个步骤都自动化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"清理自动化流水线\">清理自动化流水线</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[定期扫描: 过期开关列表] --&gt; B[安全性预检]&#10;    B --&gt; C{通过安全检查?}&#10;    C -- 否 --&gt; D[标记为需人工审查]&#10;    C -- 是 --&gt; E[AI 生成代码变更]&#10;    E --&gt; F[自动运行测试套件]&#10;    F --&gt; G{测试通过?}&#10;    G -- 否 --&gt; D&#10;    G -- 是 --&gt; H[创建 Pull Request]&#10;    H --&gt; I[人工 Code Review]&#10;    I --&gt; J[合并 + 标记开关为 Removed]\">flowchart TD\n    A[定期扫描: 过期开关列表] --&gt; B[安全性预检]\n    B --&gt; C{通过安全检查?}\n    C -- 否 --&gt; D[标记为需人工审查]\n    C -- 是 --&gt; E[AI 生成代码变更]\n    E --&gt; F[自动运行测试套件]\n    F --&gt; G{测试通过?}\n    G -- 否 --&gt; D\n    G -- 是 --&gt; H[创建 Pull Request]\n    H --&gt; I[人工 Code Review]\n    I --&gt; J[合并 + 标记开关为 Removed]</pre><h3 id=\"安全性预检规则\">安全性预检规则</h3><p>并非所有过期开关都可以自动清理。以下条件必须全部满足：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def is_safe_to_auto_clean(flag: Flag) -&gt; tuple[bool, str]:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;判断开关是否可以安全自动清理&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;&#10;    # 1. 必须是临时类型（Release 或 Experiment）&#10;    if flag.type not in [&quot;release&quot;, &quot;experiment&quot;]:&#10;        return False, &quot;永久开关不可自动清理&quot;&#10;&#10;    # 2. 必须在所有环境中推全或完全关闭&#10;    for env in flag.environments:&#10;        if not (env.percentage == 100 or env.percentage == 0):&#10;            return False, f&quot;环境 {env.name} 仍在灰度中 ({env.percentage}%)&quot;&#10;&#10;    # 3. 评估结果必须单一化超过 7 天&#10;    if flag.days_since_last_variation_change &lt; 7:&#10;        return False, &quot;评估结果仍有变化&quot;&#10;&#10;    # 4. 不能有其他开关依赖此开关&#10;    if flag.dependents:&#10;        return False, f&quot;被 {flag.dependents} 依赖&quot;&#10;&#10;    # 5. 不能有活跃实验引用此开关&#10;    if flag.active_experiments:&#10;        return False, &quot;有活跃实验依赖&quot;&#10;&#10;    return True, &quot;安全&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> is_safe_to_auto_clean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(flag: Flag) -> tuple[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"判断开关是否可以安全自动清理\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 1. 必须是临时类型（Release 或 Experiment）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flag.type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">not</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"release\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"experiment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"永久开关不可自动清理\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 2. 必须在所有环境中推全或完全关闭</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> env </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flag.environments:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (env.percentage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> env.percentage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"环境 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">env.name</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 仍在灰度中 (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">env.percentage</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">%)\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 3. 评估结果必须单一化超过 7 天</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flag.days_since_last_variation_change </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"评估结果仍有变化\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 4. 不能有其他开关依赖此开关</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flag.dependents:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"被 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">flag.dependents</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 依赖\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 5. 不能有活跃实验引用此开关</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flag.active_experiments:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"有活跃实验依赖\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"安全\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"行业实践\">行业实践</h3><p><strong>Glovo（2025）</strong>：基于 GitHub Actions 构建清理流水线，GitHub Copilot Agent Tasks 自动生成移除代码的 PR。确定性规则决定可清理集合，AI 执行代码变更。</p>\n<p><strong>Unleash（2026）</strong>：通过 MCP（Model Context Protocol）让 Claude Code / GitHub Copilot 读取开关状态，自动检测过期开关并生成清理 PR。</p>\n<p><strong>快手（2026）</strong>：AI Agent 自动判断开关安全性、生成代码变更、通过双引擎安全护栏验证后提交——目标是&quot;让开关自己下线&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组织级治理框架\">组织级治理框架</h2><h3 id=\"治理委员会\">治理委员会</h3><p>大型组织需要跨团队的开关治理机制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Flag Guardian（每团队 1 人）</td>\n<td>监控团队开关健康度、推动清理</td>\n<td>周</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Platform Team</td>\n<td>维护开关平台、提供工具支持</td>\n<td>持续</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Engineering Leadership</td>\n<td>审查组织级开关债务指标</td>\n<td>月</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"开关卫生仪表板\">开关卫生仪表板</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>健康</th>\n<th>警告</th>\n<th>危险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>过期开关占比</td>\n<td>&lt; 10%</td>\n<td>10-25%</td>\n<td>&gt; 25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无主开关数</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1-5</td>\n<td>&gt; 5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均开关年龄（Release）</td>\n<td>&lt; 14 天</td>\n<td>14-30 天</td>\n<td>&gt; 30 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>创建/归档比（月）</td>\n<td>&lt; 1.5</td>\n<td>1.5-3.0</td>\n<td>&gt; 3.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预算使用率</td>\n<td>&lt; 70%</td>\n<td>70-90%</td>\n<td>&gt; 90%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"definition-of-done-的扩展\">Definition of Done 的扩展</h3><p>将开关清理纳入&quot;完成&quot;定义：</p>\n<p><strong>传统 DoD</strong>：需求实现 → 测试通过 → 代码合并 → 部署上线</p>\n<p><strong>开关感知 DoD</strong>：需求实现 → 测试通过 → 代码合并 → 部署上线 → <strong>灰度推全</strong> → <strong>开关清理</strong> → 功能完成</p>\n<h2 id=\"技术债度量与可视化\">技术债度量与可视化</h2><h3 id=\"开关债务分-flag-debt-score\">开关债务分（Flag Debt Score）</h3><p>为每个开关计算债务分数，综合考虑年龄、类型、复杂度：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def calculate_debt_score(flag: Flag) -&gt; float:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;0-100 的债务分数，越高越紧急&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    score = 0.0&#10;&#10;    # 年龄因子（临时开关越老越紧急）&#10;    if flag.type in [&quot;release&quot;, &quot;experiment&quot;]:&#10;        age_days = (now() - flag.created_at).days&#10;        expected_life = EXPECTED_LIFE[flag.type]&#10;        overdue_ratio = max(0, age_days - expected_life) / expected_life&#10;        score += min(40, overdue_ratio * 40)&#10;&#10;    # 代码散布因子（跨越越多服务/文件越难清理）&#10;    file_count = count_files_referencing(flag.key)&#10;    score += min(20, file_count * 2)&#10;&#10;    # 依赖因子（被其他开关依赖则清理更复杂）&#10;    score += len(flag.dependents) * 5&#10;&#10;    # 无主因子&#10;    if not flag.owner or team_exists(flag.owner) is False:&#10;        score += 20&#10;&#10;    return min(100, score)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculate_debt_score</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(flag: Flag) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"0-100 的债务分数，越高越紧急\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 年龄因子（临时开关越老越紧急）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flag.type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"release\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"experiment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        age_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (now() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flag.created_at).days</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        expected_life </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> EXPECTED_LIFE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[flag.type]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        overdue_ratio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, age_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expected_life) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expected_life</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, overdue_ratio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 代码散布因子（跨越越多服务/文件越难清理）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    file_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count_files_referencing(flag.key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, file_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 依赖因子（被其他开关依赖则清理更复杂）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(flag.dependents) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 无主因子</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flag.owner </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> team_exists(flag.owner) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, score)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"与-sre-的关联\">与 SRE 的关联</h3><p>开关债务直接影响系统可靠性。与 <a href=\"../../site-reliability-engineering/\">SRE</a> 实践结合：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Error Budget 消耗</strong>：因过期开关导致的事故应计入 Error Budget</li>\n<li><strong>事故回顾</strong>：涉及开关的事故必须追踪到清理动作</li>\n<li><strong>可靠性评审</strong>：季度可靠性评审包含开关健康度报告</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>开关治理的核心原则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>预算制约</strong>：用数量上限迫使团队主动清理</li>\n<li><strong>阶梯升级</strong>：过期告警从通知到阻断逐步升级</li>\n<li><strong>AI 自动化</strong>：安全预检 + AI 代码变更 + 人工审查</li>\n<li><strong>组织责任</strong>：每个开关有明确 owner，治理嵌入 DoD</li>\n<li><strong>度量驱动</strong>：债务分数和仪表板让问题可见</li>\n</ol>\n<p>治理是 <a href=\"../foundations/flag-lifecycle-management\">开关生命周期管理</a> 在组织层面的落地。开关变更的影响追踪需要 <a href=\"observability-flag-impact\">可观测性与影响分析</a>。平台选型时治理能力是关键维度，参见 <a href=\"platform-comparison\">平台对比与选型</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"治理与技术债：开关数量控制、过期策略与代码清理自动化","id":"治理与技术债-开关数量控制-过期策略与代码清理自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要治理","id":"为什么需要治理"},{"level":2,"text":"开关预算制度","id":"开关预算制度"},{"level":3,"text":"团队级开关预算","id":"团队级开关预算"},{"level":3,"text":"创建/归档比监控","id":"创建-归档比监控"},{"level":2,"text":"过期策略与自动化","id":"过期策略与自动化"},{"level":3,"text":"过期告警阶梯","id":"过期告警阶梯"},{"level":3,"text":"过期自动执行","id":"过期自动执行"},{"level":2,"text":"AI 驱动的代码清理自动化","id":"ai-驱动的代码清理自动化"},{"level":3,"text":"清理自动化流水线","id":"清理自动化流水线"},{"level":3,"text":"安全性预检规则","id":"安全性预检规则"},{"level":3,"text":"行业实践","id":"行业实践"},{"level":2,"text":"组织级治理框架","id":"组织级治理框架"},{"level":3,"text":"治理委员会","id":"治理委员会"},{"level":3,"text":"开关卫生仪表板","id":"开关卫生仪表板"},{"level":3,"text":"Definition of Done 的扩展","id":"definition-of-done-的扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"技术债度量与可视化","id":"技术债度量与可视化"},{"level":3,"text":"开关债务分（Flag Debt Score）","id":"开关债务分-flag-debt-score"},{"level":3,"text":"与 SRE 的关联","id":"与-sre-的关联"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"特性开关下的测试：组合爆炸与策略矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/engineering/testing-with-flags"},"next":{"title":"可观测性与影响分析：开关变更到指标关联的闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/operations/observability-flag-impact"}}